sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor F as Finance staff
    actor S as Student
    participant FI as finance-service
    participant AD as admission-service
    participant K as Kafka
    participant RP as reporting-service
    participant NO as notification-service

    K->>FI: student-admitted
    FI->>AD: student profile (Feign)
    FI->>FI: plan = course fee - discount, split into instalments with due dates
    FI->>K: fee-plan-created

    F->>FI: record payment (amount, mode, reference)
    FI->>FI: refuse if the amount is more than the outstanding
    FI->>FI: apply to instalments oldest first (state is worked out each time: PAID, PARTLY_PAID, DUE, OVERDUE, UPCOMING)
    FI->>FI: receipt number
    FI->>K: payment-recorded
    K->>RP: income and collection facts
    alt outstanding becomes 0
        FI->>FI: plan ACTIVE -> SETTLED
    end

    opt Mistake
        F->>FI: reverse payment (reason)
        FI->>FI: reversed payments no longer count
        FI->>K: audit.recorded
    end

    Note over FI: InstallmentReminderJob runs on a schedule
    FI->>FI: find instalments past due and unpaid
    FI->>K: installment-overdue
    K->>RP: overdue counts for the finance desk
    S->>FI: view my fees and receipts
    FI->>FI: outstanding = net fee - successful payments, computed on every read
    FI-->>S: instalments, receipts, outstanding
